{
  "bodyHash": "2EVhyR/lQus=",
  "content": "<h3><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\">MOA装饰：卫浴系列</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">这是一款以浴室主题为核心的全新装饰模组，旨在为您的建筑增添更多细节。当前已有多个家具类模组，本模组将作为它们的补充扩展，提供数百种风格各异的装饰元素来装点您的世界。本模组隶属于</span></em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">MOA装饰</span></em></span></strong></span><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">系列。</span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/699/635/moa-sanitario7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1465\" height=\"672\"></span></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">合成系统</span></strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/932/c-sanitario-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"477\" height=\"231\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">所有物品均可通过生存模式获取。合成起始步骤：将<strong>淡蓝色染料</strong>与绿宝石放置在工作台上，即可获得<strong>9颗卫浴宝石</strong>。这些宝石配合其他材料可制作全部装饰物品。<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>共计162种独特物品！</strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/933/c-sanitario-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"477\" height=\"232\"></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong>示例：</strong>制作马桶模型需要1颗卫浴宝石作为基础材料，外加铁块、石质按钮、磨制闪长岩与水桶等附加材料。部分次级合成品由两个基础物品组合而成，此类情况无需额外消耗卫浴宝石（因其已在基础合成阶段消耗）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/934/moa-sanitario1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"476\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/935/moa-sanitario2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"492\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/936/moa-sanitario3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"470\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/937/moa-sanitario4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"481\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/938/moa-sanitario5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"610\"></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/699/634/moa-sanitario6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1465\" height=\"811\"></em></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/699/636/moa-sanitario8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1171\" height=\"753\"></em></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><em>重要说明：</em></strong></span><em>为获得完整体验，建议搭配</em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><em>MOA装饰</em></strong></span><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>系列</strong></span>其他模组使用，更多主题类别将大幅扩展装饰可能性。</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-cookery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/472/638039093834758638.png\" alt=\"MOA装饰：厨房系列\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-art\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/441/638039045898196915.png\" alt=\"MOA装饰：艺术系列\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-science\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/488/638039109952819535.png\" alt=\"MOA装饰：科技系列\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-toys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/495/638039124454094910.png\" alt=\"MOA装饰：玩具系列\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-bath\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/808/248/638178193015946116.png\" alt=\"MOA装饰：卫浴系列\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-lights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/853/442/638257035280816288.png\" alt=\"MOA装饰：灯光系列\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-garden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/872/565/638291506409003759.png\" alt=\"MOA装饰：花园系列\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-holidays\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/885/795/638321626215674397.png\" alt=\"MOA装饰：节日系列\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
